item.description:
We've all dealt with difficult people at work. But how do you know when your boss is just having a bad day or when their behavior has become toxic?

Today, I'm joined by George Stern to talk about how to handle difficult bosses, set boundaries at work, and have conversations that most people are afraid to have. We break down the biggest red flags of a toxic workplace, what to say when you're being treated unfairly, and how to stand up for yourself without making things worse.

