item.description:
Today, I'm joined by communication expert and bestselling author Vinh Giang for a conversation about the power of your voice. We break down how to sound confident even when you're nervous, use your tone to build trust, stop letting shyness hold you back, and become someone people actually want to listen to. Vinh also shares his personal journey from being afraid to speak up to teaching millions how to communicate with confidence. Whether you're speaking at work, having a difficult conversation, or trying to connect with the people you love, this episode will change the way you think about your voice.

Buy Vinh’s book, Before We Forget How To Connect - https://vinhgiang.com/before-we-forget-how-to-connect&nbsp;

