item.description:
What if the life you’re rushing through right now is the life you’ll one day wish you could get back? Sahil Bloom joins me to talk about our complicated relationship with time—and what happens when we’re so focused on what’s next that we miss what’s right in front of us. We talk about success, relationships, breaking our addiction to our phones, making better decisions with our time, and learning to appreciate the season of life we’re actually in. If you’ve ever felt too busy, distracted, or like life is moving faster than you can keep up with, this conversation is for you.

Buy Sahil’s book https://the5typesofwealth.com/&nbsp;

