item.description:
What do you do when people criticize you, misunderstand you, or challenge what you believe?

Tim Tebow joins me for a conversation about what it really means to stand your ground without losing respect for the person across from you. We talk about handling criticism, knowing when to speak up and when to walk away, getting out of the comparison trap, and surrounding yourself with people who will tell you the truth.

Check out Tim’s newest book, 40 Days to Look Again: https://timtebow.com/books/&nbsp;

Learn more about Tim’s foundation and how you can get involved: https://timtebowfoundation.org/&nbsp;

Additional resources Tim mentioned in this episode:

https://www.missingkids.org/home&nbsp;

Bark Phone

Get help. Text "THORN" to 741741 to confidentially speak with a trained counselor.

